<div class="qslbl">Tap a term, then tap its definition</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-top:4px">
<div><div class="mcol-lbl">Terms</div>${tH}</div>
<div><div class="mcol-lbl">Definitions</div>${dH}</div>
</div>
<div class="ifb" id="mtFb" style="margin-top:6px"></div>
</div>

<div class="grp-hdr">Part 5 &mdash; Essay Response</div>
<div class="qsec">
<div class="qslbl">Write a full paragraph response</div>
