</div>
</div>

<div id="scrSec" style="display:none">
<div class="grp-hdr">Your Results</div>
<div class="sscr">
<div class="scir"><div class="snum" id="sNum">0</div><div class="slbl" id="sLbl">/ 31 pts</div></div>
<div class="score-breakdown">
<div class="srow"><span class="sl">Fill in the Blank</span><span class="sv" id="sFB">&mdash;</span></div>
<div class="srow"><span class="sl">True / False</span><span class="sv" id="sTF">&mdash;</span></div>
<div class="srow"><span class="sl">Multiple Choice</span><span class="sv" id="sMC">&mdash;</span></div>
<div class="srow"><span class="sl">Matching</span><span class="sv" id="sMT">&mdash;</span></div>
</div>
<div class="enote"><strong>Essay:</strong> Your written response has been recorded. A strong essay cites at least two specific examples and explains both a helpful and harmful effect of technology in the later 2000s.</div>
